    "detailed_description": "Smash Crates is a local/online fighting game of pure chaos. BUILD, DESTROY and MANIPULATE the battlefield to your advantage. Fight for glory with up to 4 friends as the Crates of myth and legend. Be there and be square!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 to 4 player battles locally or online using Remote Play. No Single Player.<br></li><li> 3 Game modes: Battle Mode, Survival Mode and Zone Control<br></li><li> Character Customisation<br></li><li> 20 Completely destructible maps layouts<br></li><li> Terrain manipulating power ups <br></li><li> Great soundtrack</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BATTLE WITH FRIENDS</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553400/extras/776024fcecedfdae9a5040a02848ded2.poster.avif?t=1701824501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553400/extras/776024fcecedfdae9a5040a02848ded2.webm?t=1701824501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553400/extras/776024fcecedfdae9a5040a02848ded2.mp4?t=1701824501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Battle with up to 4 friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTER CUSTOMISATION</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553400/extras/e9006ed38ce40b691ec635b2b23e697b.poster.avif?t=1701824501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553400/extras/e9006ed38ce40b691ec635b2b23e697b.webm?t=1701824501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553400/extras/e9006ed38ce40b691ec635b2b23e697b.mp4?t=1701824501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Show off your style with your hat selection.<